{"features":[["fas fa-fire","Premium Coffee","Carefully sourced beans, expertly brewed. Every cup matters."],["fas fa-wifi","Free WiFi & Workspace","Fast, reliable WiFi perfect for remote work and study sessions."],["fas fa-gamepad","Gaming & Entertainment","Board games, video games, and space to hang out with friends."],["fas fa-music","Live Music Events","Local musicians perform regularly. Check our Facebook for schedule."],["fas fa-leaf","Sustainable Practices","Compostable cups, recyclables, and eco-friendly sourcing."],["fas fa-people-arrows","Community First","Local business, local love. Supporting LaPorte since 2010."]],"reviews":[["Best coffee spot in LaPorte. The staff remembers my order, and the atmosphere is perfect for getting work done.","Edward Nunn"],["Amazing pastries and consistently great coffee. This is where I meet my friends every Saturday morning.","Mary Loeffler"],["The live music events are fantastic, and the coffee is always top-notch. A real gem in our community.","James Rodriguez"],["Perfect workspace with excellent WiFi. The staff is friendly and the coffee is exceptional. Highly recommend!","Sarah Chen"]],"gallery":[["IMG_6423.jpeg","Rocky Mountain Cafe welcoming interior","fas fa-store","Interior"],["IMG_6429.jpeg","Coffee bar and counter area","fas fa-coffee","Coffee Bar"],["IMG_6430.jpeg","Pastry display case","fas fa-cookie","Pastries"],["IMG_6434.jpeg","Seating area and community space","fas fa-chair","Seating"],["IMG_6435.jpeg","Professional coffee equipment","fas fa-cog","Equipment"],["IMG_6436.jpeg","Cozy corner seating","fas fa-couch","Cozy Corner"],["IMG_6437.jpeg","Main seating area","fas fa-users","Community"],["IMG_6438.jpeg","Coffee preparation station","fas fa-mug-hot","Barista Station"]]}